.cursorrules
*.md
# design-handoff docs are canonical references (brand spec, voice guide, etc.) — must be tracked
!design-handoff/*.md
# overnight autonomous-loop status reports — must be tracked so the morning review can read them
!/OVERNIGHT-REPORT.md
!/OVERNIGHT-REPORT-2.md
!/OVERNIGHT-REPORT-3.md
# 모델 벤치마크 결과표 — 실제 요청된 산출물, 재실행 없이 이력으로 남겨야 함
!tests/benchmark/results/**/*.md
